            "review_title": "Review at Nihaoniu Hotpot",
            "review_text": "TravelingPro\nTokyo, Japan7 contributions\n0\nGreat satisfaction with fresh beef and plenty of hot pot\nAug 2025 • Couples\nI had a Cantonese clay pot and a hot pot. The soup tastes good for the body, there are many kinds of mushrooms, all vegetables are fresh, and it is also recommended for mushroom hot pot fans. Fresh meat is also very delicious and very satisfying! The reason the plate is vertical is because fresh meat doesn't slip off!\nThe clay pot was also the best.\n\nThe shop is clean and comfortable\n\nI would love to repeat it if I come on another trip.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 25, 2025",
